%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:94 (readCsv-bodyStartLineNumber-test)
testing: bodyStartLineNumber specifies where data starts
元の形: io/readCsvWithHeaders の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
read("meta1\nmeta2\nname,age\nAlice,30\nBob,25", "application/csv", {"headerLineNumber": 2, "bodyStartLineNumber": 3})
%%% output application/json
[
  {
    "meta2": "name",
    "column_1": "age"
  },
  {
    "meta2": "Alice",
    "column_1": "30"
  },
  {
    "meta2": "Bob",
    "column_1": "25"
  }
]
